      "text": "Alamoth -- Alamoth, \"soprano,\" from almah, a virgin. Some have thought the alamoth, \"virgins,\" were a temple choir, singing antiphonally to the sheminith, or male choir. (See Scofield \"Psalms 6:1\"). But contr, see 1 Chronicles 15:20."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
